  <li id="thy-r6"><span class="rf-for">吸音率の表（付録。値は pyroomacoustics の materials.json の転記で確かめた）</span><span class="rf-src">M. Vorländer, <i>Auralization</i>, Springer, 2008, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-540-48830-9" target="_blank" rel="noopener">doi:10.1007/978-3-540-48830-9</a>; <a href="https://github.com/LCAV/pyroomacoustics/blob/master/pyroomacoustics/data/materials.json" target="_blank" rel="noopener">pyroomacoustics materials.json</a></span></li>
